      ],
      "answer": "54.6米",
      "acceptedAnswers": [
        "54.6米"
      ],
      "explanationZhHans": "设CD=h，则AD=h/tan30°=h√3，BD=h/tan45°=h。由AB=AD-BD得40=h√3-h，解得h=40/(√3-1)=20(√3+1)≈54.6米。"
